      "utf8": "like you can on Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074340,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love the way they scaffold\nyou through a topic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076810,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "building your understanding\nand your confidence as you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079950,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as someone with a\nPhD in science education,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082960,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
